98_ShockedCosmotchi.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20260502040116","caption":"TVA98 ShockedCosmotchi.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/04/TVA98_ShockedCosmotchi.png/revision/latest?cb=20260502040116"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Happy_Cosmotchi.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/7/7a/Happy_Cosmotchi.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20150617135129","caption":"Радуется","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/7/7a/Happy_Cosmotchi.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150617135129"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TVA102_CarRide.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/7/72/TVA102_CarRide.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20260502040308","caption":"TVA102 CarRide.png","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/7/72/TVA102_CarRide.png/revision/latest?cb=20260502040308"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Cosmotchi_video_adventures.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/0a/Cosmotchi_video_adventures.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20150617131535","caption":"Cosmotchi video adventures.jpg","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/0a/Cosmotchi_video_adventures.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150617131535"}],"related":[]}